<TITLE>Intermediate Shaft</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A shaft contraction mechanism is used in the intermediate shaft.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>In a collision, the slide mechanism of the intermediate shaft contracts due to the input from the steering gear box direction, absorbing the impact and restraining the steering column and steering wheel from being pushed into the cabin.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
